rch 29.2026 NCAA tournament Final Four round March Madness games at Lucas Oil Stadium in IndianapolisLucas Oil Stadium in Indianapolis, 6 p.m. and 8:30 p.m. ET, Saturday, April 4, TBS.March Madness 2026 NCAA tournament championship game at Lucas Oil Stadium in IndianapolisLucas Oil Stadium in Indianapolis, 8:30 p.m. ET, Monday, April 6, TBS.Watch the NCAA men's basketball tournament live on Sling TVMarch Madness 2026 NCAA tournament scores, results: Who won NCAA tournament men's basketball games last night?2026 NCAA tournament First Four March Madness games last night: Tuesday, March 17(16) Howard 86, (16) UMBC 83 | Box score(11) Texas 68, (11) NC State 66 | Box score Watch March Madness on Sling TVWhere to stream 2026 NCAA tournament men's basketball March Madness gamesThe NCAA tournament will stream on Paramount+. Fans can download Paramount+ in the Apple App Store or on Google Play.Watch March Madness action on Paramount+2026 NCAA tournament odds for March Madness bracket betting: BetMGMVisit www.in.betmgm.com for the latest odds of every NCAA tournament men's basketball game.2026 March Madness bracket picks, predictions for NCAA tournament men's basketballCompare your March Madness bracket to the USA Today experts. See every pick from 10 different brackets.March Madness bracket 2026 NCAA men's basketball tournament bracketMarch Madness bracket 2026 NCAA men's basketball tournament printable bracketClick here for a 2026 March Madness printable bracket PDFChris Sims is a trending reporter at Midwest Connect Gannett. Follow him on Twitter: @ChrisFSims.",
